    "functions": [
      {
        "does": "The gear on top at the back of the cab roof steers the front wheels: a shaft runs down the back of the cab to an 8 tooth gear and a 24 tooth gear, whose arm works the steering links.",
        "source": "book: bag 3 steps (the hogxmit gears), page 420 (bottom left photo, the arrows on the roof gear and the front wheel)",
        "control": "p1146 18575",
        "moves": [
          "p537 3648b",
          "p502 56145",
          "p512 56145"
        ],
        "stays": [
          "p324 3708"
        ]
      },
      {
        "does": "Pushed along, the tractor's two rear axles drive the six cylinder engine under the bonnet: each axle has a differential, a shaft through universal joints runs forward to the crankshaft, and the six pistons run up and down.",
        "source": "book: bag 1 steps 3-15 (the two differentials and the shaft between them), engine steps in bag 2; page 420 (top right photo, the arrows on the pistons)",
        "control": [
          "p199 56145",
          "p202 56145",
